flowchart TD
BufferCapacityProblem["**BufferCapacityProblem**
Attributes
- n_var {6}
- n_obj {2}
- xl {1-10}
- xu {1-10}
- n_replications
- base_seed
- n_cores
Methods
- _evaluate X batch evaluation using multiprocessing pool"] 

NSGA2Algorithm["**NSGA2 Algorithm**
Attributes
- pop_size
- sampling IntegerRandomSampling
- crossover SBX
- mutation PM
- eliminate_duplicates
Methods
- run optimization via minimize"] 

RunNSGA2["**run_nsga2_optimization**
Description
- Construct BufferCapacityProblem
- Configure NSGA2 Algorithm
- Call minimize to run optimization
- Return result with history"] 

MultiprocessingPool["**Multiprocessing Pool**
Attributes
- processes equal to n_cores
Methods
- map evaluate tasks in parallel"] 

EvaluateIndividual["**evaluate_single_individual**
Attributes
- x vector candidate capacities
- n_replications
- base_seed
Methods
- repeat simulations across replications
- aggregate avg_wip and avg_throughput
Returns
- objective vector [avg_wip, negative avg_throughput]"] 

RunSimWithCaps["**run_simulation_with_caps**
Attributes
- caps 6 integers {1-10}
- simulation parameters warmup measure_until
Returns
- result dict containing overall throughput wip produced_parts and machine_energy
Description
- Build DelayBuffer instances with given caps
- Instantiate Machine objects
- Run simpy simulation and sample wip and throughput"] 

DelayBufferClass["**DelayBuffer**
Attributes
- cap
- delay
- store
- tokens
- in_transit counter
Methods
- put part delayed put
- get part and release token
- in_transit_count
- free_capacity"] 

MachineClass["**Machine**
Attributes
- name
- input_buffer
- output_buffer
- process_time
- availability
- mttr
- working_power
- waiting_power
- capacity
- resource
- worker_processes
- stats working_time failed_time_total wait_input_time blocked_time processed_count
Methods
- run process lifecycle
- _breakdown_cycle failure and repair
- waiting_energy_consumption
- working_energy_consumption"] 

InputCapacities["**Input Variables**
Description
- All buffer capacities
- 6 discrete values each in {1-10}"] 

Objectives["**MOO Objectives**
Description
- Minimize wip
- Maximize throughput"] 

ExportHistory["**export_history_to_csv**
Description
- Read result.history from optimizer
- Write CSV with generation individual caps wip throughput"] 

SimulationOutputs["**Simulation Outputs**
Description
- overall throughput
- overall wip
- produced_parts
- machine_energy per machine"] 

%% Flow relations illustrating interaction between components
RunNSGA2 --> NSGA2Algorithm
RunNSGA2 --> BufferCapacityProblem
NSGA2Algorithm --> BufferCapacityProblem
BufferCapacityProblem --> MultiprocessingPool
MultiprocessingPool --> EvaluateIndividual
EvaluateIndividual --> RunSimWithCaps
RunSimWithCaps --> DelayBufferClass
RunSimWithCaps --> MachineClass
RunSimWithCaps --> SimulationOutputs
EvaluateIndividual --> SimulationOutputs
BufferCapacityProblem --> Objectives
RunNSGA2 --> ExportHistory
ExportHistory --> SimulationOutputs

%% Data flow from inputs to simulations
InputCapacities --> BufferCapacityProblem
InputCapacities --> RunSimWithCaps

%% Objective feedback loop
SimulationOutputs --> EvaluateIndividual
EvaluateIndividual --> BufferCapacityProblem
BufferCapacityProblem --> NSGA2Algorithm
NSGA2Algorithm --> RunNSGA2

%% Notes on parallelism and aggregation
MultiprocessingPool -. parallel map .-> EvaluateIndividual
EvaluateIndividual -. aggregates across replications .-> BufferCapacityProblem

%% End of diagram